# Vercel by default excludes any folder literally named "node_modules" from
# static uploads. Expo's web export hashes vector-icon font assets using
# their original node_modules-relative path, so without this override the
# icon fonts (Ionicons, etc.) 404 in production even though they build fine
# locally — this is why icons render on Expo Go but disappear on the deployed
# web build. See https://github.com/vercel/vercel/issues/10791
!assets/node_modules/**
